Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:26.12,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.47,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:31.54,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.55,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.92,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.33,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.34,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.60,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.61,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:01.34,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:06.42,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:08.73,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.51,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:14.15,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:16.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:19.74,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.20,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:22.55,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:25.08,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.58,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:30.51,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:34.04,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:26.12,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透過望遠鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.47,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注視著的你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:31.54,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.55,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}彷彿顛倒一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.92,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雙腳無法踏實著地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.33,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上雲端
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.34,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}無處安放的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只會感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.60,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.61,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」這類的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:01.34,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雖然沒有任何效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:06.42,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:08.73,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}還是忍不住會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.51,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜歡你。喜歡？超喜歡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:14.15,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能說得出口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:16.36,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:19.74,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作響的回憶
Comment: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.20,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.57,0:20:22.55,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不夠 不夠 還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:25.08,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分還不夠
Comment: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.58,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想觸碰 想觸碰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:30.51,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的愛凍結之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:34.04,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}請你將它溫暖起來
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
